    "content": {
      "snl": "variable(__list__(Type.annotation(@X,Type),Type.annotation(@x,X),Type.annotation(@y,X),Type.annotation(@p,Path(x,y))),theorem(FundamentalGroup.fundamentalGroupMulEquivOfPath(p), , ))",
      "markdown": {
        "type": "i18n",
        "default_language": "en",
        "values": {
          "en": "A path $h$ from $x_0$ to $x_1$ induces the **change-of-basepoint map** $\\beta_h\\colon\\pi_1(X,x_1)\\to\\pi_1(X,x_0)$, $\\beta_h[f]=[h\\cdot f\\cdot\\overline{h}]$, which is a group isomorphism (Hatcher Proposition 1.5, p. 28).",
          "zh-CN": "从 $x_0$ 到 $x_1$ 的道路 $h$ 诱导**基点变换映射** $\\beta_h\\colon\\pi_1(X,x_1)\\to\\pi_1(X,x_0)$，$\\beta_h[f]=[h\\cdot f\\cdot\\overline{h}]$，它是群同构（Hatcher 命题 1.5，第 28 页）。"
        }
      }
    },
